nt\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20140615114131&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Bag_e44484.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a glooth bag.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 30.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use it to get one of the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Spear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Spear_a728f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 2 Glooth Spears</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Club\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Club_f786fd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Glooth Club</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Amulet_a703bc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Glooth Amulet</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Blade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Blade_75a03d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Glooth Blade</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Sandwich\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Sandwich_a17f32.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 10 Glooth Sandwiches</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Axe_e33879.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Glooth Axe</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bowl of Glooth Soup\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bowl_of_Glooth_Soup_7daabe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 10 Bowls of Glooth Soup</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Steak\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Steak_53ec20.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> 10 Glooth Steaks</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glooth Backpack\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Backpack_421fbe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Glooth Backpack</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Control Unit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Control_Unit_54f96a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> Control Unit</li></ul>\n<p>Considering the prices of the 4 items that can be sold to <a href=\"#/wiki/Flint\">Flint</a> and the opening statistics, each Glooth Bag is worth approximately 970 gp.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Glooth Bag/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deep%20Terror\">Deep Terror</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Empowered%20Glooth%20Horror\">Empowered Glooth Horror</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Bandit\">Glooth Bandit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Brigand\">Glooth Brigand